Lunacy's own: the account type and page that mirror Android's contacts and calendars into
Contacts and Calendar, one way (AndroidContacts.kt and AndroidCalendar.kt in
AndroidLuna/src/main/java/org/webosarchive/lunacy/card/). Its icons are
HP's Contacts icon (com.palm.app.contacts, released by LG Electronics under the Apache License
2.0, as webOS CE's 3.2.0 carries it), scaled.
